{"ID":"20240314091831-fnaxplr","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240314091831-fnaxplr","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240314091831-fnaxplr\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240422170535-1kfv60o\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240422170535-c9978b0\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:374,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240422170535-hcxue8z\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:228,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:228\u0026#125;","title":"【桂枝茯苓丸】","type":"doc","updated":"20240422170535"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240422170535-1kfv60o","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240422170535-1kfv60o","updated":"20240422170535"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"妇人宿有"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"癥"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"病，经水断，未及三月，而得漏下不止，胎动在脐上者，此为"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"癥痼害"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。妊娠六月动者，前三月经水利时，胎也；下血者，断后三月，衃也。所以下血不止者，其"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"癥"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"不去故也，当下其"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"癥"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，桂枝茯苓丸主之。"}]},{"ID":"20240422170535-o87nu3h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422170535-o87nu3h","updated":"20240422170535"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"font-size: 24px; color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text strong","TextMarkTextContent":"桂枝茯苓丸方："},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"font-size: 24px; color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240422170535-xr33a26","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422170535-xr33a26","updated":"20240422170535"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"桂枝茯苓牡丹（去心）芍药桃仁（去皮尖熬）各等分"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240422170535-qupu44q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422170535-qupu44q","updated":"20240422170535"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"上五味，末之，炼蜜和丸，如兔屎大，每日食前服一丸，不知，加至三丸。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240422170535-6zru8md","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422170535-6zru8md","updated":"20240422170535"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"大家来看这一条，那个太太小姐呢，本来子宫里面就有肿瘤，有肌瘤，“"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"经水断，及三月而得漏下不止，动在脐上者，此为癥痼害也。"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"”意思是什么？就是一个病人呢，她原来前面三个月的月经...我们一般来说，（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"妇科"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"）问女孩子的时候，我们都会问月经。你现在有流血出来，那我们可能是子宫肿瘤、肌瘤，或者是你根本就是这个子宫颈癌，这不正常的出血；或者是你是怀孕的，有失血，小孩子要准备流掉的，那你怎么知道？这个条辩就在讲这个。"}]},{"ID":"20240422170535-ak3z86c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422170535-ak3z86c","updated":"20240422170535"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"一般来说我们问太太，您多久没有月经了？（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"病人答"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"）我三个月没有月经了，那你在没有月经之前三个月，月经如何？我在月经停掉之前前三个月月经都非常得准时。当我们知道她"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"月经很准时，突然没有月经的时候，很可能就是怀孕了"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，如果她月经不准时，有时侯拖一个月，有时 delay，有时一个月来两次，有时两个月来一次，常常忽快忽慢或者是一直延后，然后越延越长，现在是不正常出血，那可能就有癥，就是子宫里面那有这个肿瘤。"}]},{"ID":"20240422170535-id446kx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422170535-id446kx","updated":"20240422170535"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那这边你看哦，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"妊娠六个动者，前三月经水利时，胎也"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。如果你前面三个月怀孕都很好，你前面怀孕六个月都没有月经，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"在六个月没有月经之前的那 3 个月月经都很准时，到怀孕到第 6 个月的时候就会有胎动，胎会动"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。那如果说，你前 3 个月的月经呢非常好，然后你怀孕了...一般我们都是以 90 天为一个周期...你前三个月的月经很好，现在没有月经了，怀孕了，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"怀孕了以后第 3 个月又开始有流血出来，糟糕，是怀孕了，但是可能会流产流掉了"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，它是这个意思。如果是坏血，就是前3个月月经不正常，不正常很可能有肌瘤、肿瘤在里面。然后3个月没有月经，没有月经以后第3个月来的是黑的血，血块很多，我们知道，她根本没有怀孕，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"所以判断有没有怀孕很简单，在停经之前，你问她前 3 个月，前 3 个月的月经非常好，很可能就怀孕了"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]},{"ID":"20240422170535-l8utw7c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422170535-l8utw7c","updated":"20240422170535"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那我们用"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"桂枝茯苓丸呢，就是专门祛癥，祛瘕，就是这个子宫里面的肌瘤"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。原方呢，你看哦，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"桂枝、茯苓、牡丹、桃仁、芍药"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。开这个处方出来的时候，我们心里就知道了为什么这个子宫里面会长肌瘤或长肿瘤，因为寒！"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"里面有寒，还有水"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"！寒呢，东西会累积在里面，可能会是你的月经没有完全排完，停在子宫里面。还有一种可能是你过去有流过产，没有排得很干净，堵在里面。那基本上是有寒有水。"}]},{"ID":"20240422170535-19ncd8h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422170535-19ncd8h","updated":"20240422170535"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"所以说，我们开处方的时候，桂枝呢可以把心火导到小肠里面来，导到子宫里面来，这就要靠桂枝，所以"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"心脏的热导到下焦来，就是桂枝"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。那"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"茯苓呢要祛它的水，桂枝就是祛它的寒"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"牡丹、桃仁是攻它的淤血"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"芍药呢是止腹痛"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。那如果说你没有怀孕，吃这个桂枝茯苓丸，针对子宫的一般的肌瘤也会有效，你如果是比较严重的癌症的话就没有效，力量不够，因为寒就会很盛，而且是实，里面有东西堵到，不单单是水。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"这个实的时候，我们要靠很热的药，所以我们会加一些生附子，加一些硫磺在里面"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。这两种药等量，我们同时把它放到桂枝茯苓丸里面，那"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"硫磺能够祛水又能祛寒，生附子能够祛寒"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。所以这两个放在里面可以把实、寒实去掉。所以我们做的桂枝茯苓丸那就跟他们的不一样了，那很强，很快！"}]},{"ID":"20240422170535-yoc9yxl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422170535-yoc9yxl","updated":"20240422170535"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那这个桂枝茯苓丸，除了你对子宫、卵巢方面的病有效外以外，你如果说月经痛或月经不准时，每次来月经都很强烈的痛，只要是症状是合到的，统统可以用这个处方，不一定是要去一定确定里面有什么肿瘤啊才去使用它。"}]},{"ID":"20240422170535-hcxue8z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422170535-hcxue8z","updated":"20240422170535"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那你要做成这个兔子大便那么大，不要去那么麻烦去记啊！我们还要跑到动物园去看兔子大便，不需要的。我们平时那个"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"六味地黄丸"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"吃 30 颗，不会说是"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"一丸"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，这个一丸体积一定很大。这餐前一颗...我们那个小粒粒还好吞嘛，那么大一颗你怎么吞啊？"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"我们吃个30颗，也可以吃个40颗到50颗"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。吃下去啊，大家要记得啊，这个病人吃你的药以后，你要问他有没有效，吃完以后一个礼拜、两个礼拜脚脚冷的还是热的？吃了你的药以后，哇，手脚都温热起来，那你继续吃不要停，好不好？越吃越冷就不对了，说明她还有其他的问题，这马上就可以知道这个药有没有效。"}]},{"ID":"20240422170535-lidqo26","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422170535-lidqo26","updated":"20240422170535"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"所以很多乳癌开完刀，做完化疗以后，西医说要连续几年吃这个药吃啊，才不会发XXX（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"英文，病名"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"），讲了很多的西药要吃。我就想，那5年的时间很长啊，对不对？那你怎么知道有没有效呢，万一她要连吃 5年才行...你去问她，你吃了多久？哦，吃了两个礼拜（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"病人答"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"）。脚热的冷的？脚是冷的（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"病人答"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"）。吃之前呢？温度还比较好，越吃脚越冷的（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"病人答"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"），那这个根本就没有效！"}]},{"ID":"20240422170535-6qa6vl2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422170535-6qa6vl2","updated":"20240422170535"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"所以我们为什么常常写那个论文出来骂，因为临床上问了，你说C型肝炎要吃这个XXX（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"药名"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"），你吃那个干扰素以后，手脚温度如何？越吃越冰，还想去自杀，哇，讲了一大堆问题出来。那我们有很好的处方来治疗 C 型肝炎，不需要用那么暴力的方法来治啊！还有的人吃完以后还是没有效啊，还会产生其他的后遗症。"}]},{"ID":"20240422170535-c9978b0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422170535-c9978b0","updated":"20240422170535"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"所以说，这个你要判断这个本身控制性的西药，对病人有没有帮助？两三个问题就知道了。"}]}]}